    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27261" root="طوخ" body-key="T">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاخَهُ</span></b> , (K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَطُوخُهُ</span>, (TA,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوْخٌ</span>; (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاخَهُ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَطِيخُهُ</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْخٌ</span>; which is the more common; (TA;) <i>He
charged, reproached,</i> or <i>upbraided, him with
something bad, evil, abominable,</i> or <i>foul, either
said</i> or <i>done.</i> (K.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طيخ</span>.]

